-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Fetching
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The artifacts above are intentionally not committed to this repository.

  - Opus-MT weights + SentencePiece tokenizers ....... make models
  - FLEURS test parquets (vi_vn, en_us) .............. make data
  - Eval manifest built from those parquets .......... make bench-data

All fetched artifacts are pinned to the revisions and SHA-256 digests recorded in
`assets.lock.toml`. The FLEURS validation fixture under `tests/fixtures/` is not
redistributed and is not currently used by the test suite.

**Gap, recorded rather than implied:** M2M-100 and the parakeet checkpoint are
the models that ship, and neither is fetched or pinned by this repository yet —
M2M-100 is on disk under `models/` from an unpinned conversion, and parakeet is
staged in the private on-device repository. A clean clone of this repository
therefore cannot reproduce the shipped app's models. Pinning both in
`assets.lock.toml` is tracked in [`HANDOFF.md`](HANDOFF.md).

If you redistribute any fetched artifact, you must carry the license terms and
attribution recorded above.
